5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 骑士•奋勇当先！.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/98/tu9mdldj6009skekcpkwyxq7bjbrweo.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E2%80%A2%E5%A5%8B%E5%8B%87%E5%BD%93%E5%85%88%EF%BC%81.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/98/tu9mdldj6009skekcpkwyxq7bjbrweo.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E2%80%A2%E5%A5%8B%E5%8B%87%E5%BD%93%E5%85%88%EF%BC%81.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/98/tu9mdldj6009skekcpkwyxq7bjbrweo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />骑士•奋勇当先！\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>近战、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）攻击前获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"奋勇当先！\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">奋勇当先！</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合；单体攻击，对目标造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">190%</font>伤害，同时附加<font color=\"#ed7950\">110%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">物理护盾值</span>]的伤害：攻击后移除自身所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]。拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">奋勇当先!</span>]时，技能变更为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">立盾•转攻为守</font></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-1 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/75/i12b13xi6nu3o31dwphrlipg2xm3bxm.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-1_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/75/i12b13xi6nu3o31dwphrlipg2xm3bxm.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%85%8B%E6%8B%89%E6%8B%89\" title=\"角色图鉴库/克拉拉\"><img alt=\"头像 克拉拉.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1b/he10i3yxupczk82a0dnmgnkcfe0rtzn.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">克拉拉</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left; width:80px;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"skill_icon_box\">\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"立盾•转攻为守\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_bg\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%AB%8B%E7%9B%BE%E2%80%A2%E8%BD%AC%E6%94%BB%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%88\" title=\"技能图鉴库/立盾•转攻为守\"><img alt=\"技能背景 传说.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png/70px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E4%BC%A0%E8%AF%B4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png/105px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E4%BC%A0%E8%AF%B4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"127\" data-file-height=\"127\" /></a></div>\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"立盾•转攻为守\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%AB%8B%E7%9B%BE%E2%80%A2%E8%BD%AC%E6%94%BB%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%88\" title=\"技能图鉴库/立盾•转攻为守\"><img alt=\"技能 立盾•转攻为守.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f4/oqshk8tvfyyzlc4xai067rdbrlxh44l.png/70px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%AB%8B%E7%9B%BE%E2%80%A2%E8%BD%AC%E6%94%BB%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%88.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f4/oqshk8tvfyyzlc4xai067rdbrlxh44l.png/105px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%AB%8B%E7%9B%BE%E2%80%A2%E8%BD%AC%E6%94%BB%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%88.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f4/oqshk8tvfyyzlc4xai067rdbrlxh44l.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"skill_icon_name\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%